    "content": "<div class=\"case-diagram-container\">\r\n  <div class=\"header-box\">\r\n    <span class=\"badge gold\">行政法 重要判例 #103 🎉</span>\r\n    <h3>事前通知 (行手法15条)</h3>\r\n    <p>処分前に通知→義務？</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"ruling-box\">\r\n    <div class=\"ruling-header\"><span class=\"gavel\">⚖️</span> 判断</div>\r\n    <div class=\"ruling-content\">\r\n      <p class=\"conclusion\"><strong>事前通知の義務</strong></p>\r\n      <div class=\"logic-flow\">\r\n        <p>不利益処分をする場合、<span class=\"check\">予定される処分の内容・根拠法令・原因事実を事前に通知しなければならない</span></p>\r\n        <p style=\"margin-top: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 1.5em; color: #e67e22;\">\r\n          🎊 100件達成おめでとうございます！ 🎊\r\n        </p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<style>\r\n  .case-diagram-container { font-family: \"Hiragino Sans\", Meiryo, sans-serif; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(231, 124, 34, 0.3); }\r\n  .header-box { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e67e22; padding-bottom: 10px; }\r\n  .header-box h3 { margin: 10px 0 5px; font-size: 1.2em; color: #2c3e50; }\r\n  .badge { color: #fff; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: bold; }\r\n  .badge.gold { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f39c12 0%, #e67e22 100%); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }\r\n  .ruling-box { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef9fe 0%, #fff8e1 100%); border: 2px solid #e67e22; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 20px; }\r\n  .ruling-header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5A9BD5 0%, #e67e22 100%); color: #fff; padding: 8px 15px; font-weight: bold; display: flex; align-items: center; }\r\n  .gavel { margin-right: 8px; font-size: 1.2em; }\r\n  .ruling-content { padding: 15px; }\r\n  .conclusion { font-size: 1.2em; color: #2980b9; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center; }\r\n  .logic-flow { text-align: left; font-size: 0.9em; background: #fff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; line-height: 1.6; }\r\n  .check { background: #27ae60; color: #fff; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: bold; }\r\n  @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.05); } }\r\n</style>"
